  "instructions": [
    {
      "id": 52372,
      "primary_message": "Fill a large pot halfway with water, cover, and bring to a boil. Uncover, add salt and pasta, and stir for a few seconds. Cook until desired firmness, 8-10 minutes.",
      "secondary_message": "about 14 cups water\n2 tbsp salt\n340 g (1 quarter coin = 56 g) spaghetti pasta"
    },
    {
      "id": 52373,
      "primary_message": "Peel and mince garlic. In a medium bowl, prepare sauce by whisking together garlic, water, peanut butter, vinegar, soy sauce, maple syrup, oil, and pepper.",
      "secondary_message": "2 cloves garlic\n4 tbsp warm water\n8 tbsp natural peanut butter\n2 tbsp rice vinegar\n2 tbsp soy sauce\n1 tbsp pure maple syrup\n1 tbsp toasted sesame oil\n¼ tsp crushed red pepper"
    },
    {
      "id": 52374,
      "primary_message": "Toss broccoli slaw into a large bowl. Wash and dry cilantro. Shave leaves off the stems; discard the stems and mince the leaves. Add to bowl.",
      "secondary_message": "1 (340 g) pkg broccoli slaw\r\n1 small bunch cilantro"
    },
    {
      "id": 52375,
      "primary_message": "Wash and cut lime into wedges. Roughly chop peanuts.",
      "secondary_message": "1 lime\r\n½ cup peanuts, roasted unsalted "
    },
    {
      "id": 52376,
      "primary_message": "Drain pasta in a colander and rinse under cold water. Shake to drain excess liquid, then add to bowl with broccoli slaw.",
      "secondary_message": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52377,
      "primary_message": "Pour peanut sauce over top and toss to coat.",
      "secondary_message": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52378,
      "primary_message": "To serve, place noodles in a bowl and garnish with peanuts and lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "secondary_message": ""
    }
  ],
